<view class="login-page"><view class="login-hero"><view class="rail"></view><image class="logo" src="/assets/escape-garage-wordmark.png" mode="aspectFit" style="width:260rpx;height:82rpx;object-fit:contain;object-position:center;background:transparent"/><view class="brand">ESCAPE车房</view><view class="brand-en">EPGARAGE · MEMBER CLUB</view><view class="slogan">每一次到店，都值得被认真记录</view></view><view class="login-panel"><view class="title">选择登录身份</view><view class="muted">会员可查看爱车与服务记录；门店工作人员可进入工作台管理日常业务。</view><view class="benefits"><view><text>01</text>会员余额与预约进度</view><view><text>02</text>车辆及贴膜档案</view><view><text>03</text>门店服务记录完整保留</view></view><view class="login-type">会员登录</view><view class="privacy-consent" bindtap="togglePrivacy"><view class="consent-box {{privacyAgreed ? 'checked' : ''}}">{{privacyAgreed ? '✓' : ''}}</view><view>我已阅读并同意<text class="privacy-link" catchtap="openPrivacy">《用户隐私保护指引》</text></view></view><button class="button-primary login-button" wx:if="{{devMode}}" bindtap="mockLogin">进入会员中心</button><button class="button-primary login-button" wx:else open-type="getPhoneNumber" bindgetphonenumber="authorizePhone">微信手机号登录</button><view class="login-type staff-type">商家登录</view><button class="staff-button" bindtap="goStaffLogin">进入门店工作台</button><view class="privacy">商家登录仅限已授权的店长与店员账号；<text class="privacy-link" bindtap="openPrivacy">查看隐私保护指引</text></view></view></view>
